{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"弥迦书","commonName":"弥迦书","title":"弥迦书","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"2f452e45ab0a57cd41ee90eea1e3a317e2fb9fa13c9d1eb63e3a525aa69770b1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华谴责以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要听耶和华的话：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“起来，你们要在高山面前申辩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让丘陵听你们诉说。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"群山啊，大地永固的根基啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要听耶和华的控告！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华要控告祂的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指控以色列人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"“我的子民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我做了什么对不起你们的事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我哪里令你们厌烦？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回答我！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾带你们出埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你们从受奴役之地救赎出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又差遣摩西、亚伦和米利暗引领你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要回想摩押王巴勒的阴谋以及比珥之子巴兰给他的回答，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要回想你们从什亭到吉甲途中的遭遇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以便认识耶和华公义的作为。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我要拿什么朝见耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在天上的上帝面前叩拜呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要献上一岁的牛犊作燔祭吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华岂会喜爱成千的公羊和万条油河？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我岂可因过犯而献上自己的长子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因心中的罪恶而献上亲生的骨肉？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华已经指示你们何为良善。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂向你们所要的是什么呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是要你们行公义，好怜悯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谦卑地与你们的上帝同行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"智者必敬畏耶和华的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂在向耶路撒冷呼喊：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“聚在你里面的众人都要听！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我岂会忘记恶人家中的不义之财和可恶的小升斗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我岂会放过使用不公道的秤和砝码的人？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的富人残暴成性，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"居民谎话连篇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"满口诡诈之言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要重重地击打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你的罪恶而毁灭你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你吃，却吃不饱，仍然腹中空空。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你聚敛钱财，却保不住。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你保住的，我要交给刀剑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你撒种，却不得收割；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你榨橄榄，却无油抹身；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你踩葡萄，却无酒可喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你遵守暗利的恶规，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"效法亚哈家的恶行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"随从他们的计谋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要使你荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让你的居民成为笑柄。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要蒙受列国的羞辱。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MIC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}